ests used: 2/8.\nReply with exactly one action JSON on the last line.","reply":"New hypothesis: in a mixed row, recolor to 1 the color that matches the nearest pure (single-color) rows — the \"background\" of the block. This fits all demos, and for the test means 3s→1 (pure rows are all 3).\n\n```python\ndef transform(grid):\n    h = len(grid)\n    pure = {}\n    for i, row in enumerate(grid):\n        s = set(row)\n        if len(s) == 1:\n            pure[i] = next(iter(s))\n    out = []\n    for i, row in enumerate(grid):\n        s = set(row)\n        if len(s) <= 1:\n            out.append(row[:])\n            continue\n        bg = None\n        d = 1\n        while bg is None and (i - d >= 0 or i + d < h):\n            if i - d >= 0 and i - d in pure:\n                bg = pure[i - d]\n            elif i + d < h and i + d in pure:\n                bg = pure[i + d]\n            d += 1\n        if bg is None:\n            out.append(row[:])\n        else:\n            out.append([1 if v == bg else v for v in row])\n    return out\n```\n\n{\"action\": \"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit","correct":false,"valid":true}},{"step":95,"kind":"observation","phase":"act","t0":1793238637.65,"t1":1793238760.47,"alias":"task-41ad435a","message":"Feedback since your last action:\nYour submission was INCORRECT. Wrong attempts so far: 4.\n\nSame instance. Task id: task-41ad435a\nTest input (12x24):\n8 8 8 8 3 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3 8\n3 8 3 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3 8 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n8 8 8 8 8 8 8 3 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 3 8 3 8 3 3 3 3 3\n8 3 8 3 8 3 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 3 8 3 8 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3\n3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3 3